.astro/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Supabase volumes (database data, storage files)
dockerized/supabase/volumes/

# Plane seeder run-state (created-ID cache)
scripts/plane/state/

# Runtime data — never commit
# The backup/monitoring SCRIPTS are infrastructure, not runtime data. A plain
# `backups/` rule swallowed them whole, so the scripts protecting every service
# on this box had no version history at all. Note this must exclude the CONTENTS
# (`backups/*`), not the directory: git will not descend into a directory
# excluded with a trailing slash, so a later `!backups/scripts/` can never
# re-include anything. The multi-GB encrypted tars stay excluded.
backups/*
!backups/scripts/
backups/scripts/*
!backups/scripts/*.sh
stalwart/
roundcube/db/
leadgen/state/
supabase/volumes/
*.bak-*
